      "type": "story",
      "narration": "The keeper unfolds a cloth map. Yesterday's whale lane runs straight into empty sky. Before anyone goes near the folds, she needs a waiting rope by the big rock and a wide grass lane. The wind tries to fold the map. Olivia pins it with a hoof.",
